<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX closes slightly higher,recovery falters.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes slightly higher,recovery falters.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Czech RPIX closes slightly higher on Wednesday as profit taking hits some major issues.</p>
<p>*  .RPIX 1.8 points, 0.17 percent up to 1,045.3.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 60.2 million crowns.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom falls 21 crowns to 3,110.</p>
<p>* CEZ falls 33 crowns to 945.</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka gains 118 crowns to 2,075.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
